# Requested scope

- Build the features the user asks for and the implementation needed to make them work.
- Ask before adding optional product behavior, convenience features, recovery flows, or extra persistence.
- Keep unsaved form values and other temporary UI state in component/form state. Refreshing or leaving may discard them.
- Do not add localStorage drafts, autosave, draft recovery/import, or unsaved-change navigation/refresh prompts unless explicitly requested.
- Preserve explicitly requested backend saves, authentication, ownership checks, and cleanup needed for existing features.
- Apply this preference across the project, not only to the agent editor.
